    "$$\\begin{aligned} \\lim_{x\\to2}\\frac{\\sqrt{x+7}-3}{x-2} &= \\lim_{x\\to2}\\frac{(x+7)-9}{(x-2)(\\sqrt{x+7}+3)} \\ &= \\lim_{x\\to2}\\frac{x-2}{(x-2)(\\sqrt{x+7}+3)} \\ &= \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{9}+3} = \\frac{1}{6} \\end{aligned}$$\n\n따라서 정답은 ②이다."
